      "content": "That's a pretty clear ranking. I'm a bit surprised you put Washington last though. His track record in urban development is actually incredibly impressive and shows he can manage complex moving parts and high-level stakeholders. \n\nExplain more about that 'instant credibility' point. Are you saying his specific background or the nature of the work he's done might make it harder for him to connect with a traditional C-suite audience compared to someone like Sterling? Walk me through the specific 'cultural fit' nuances you're seeing there.",
